WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:08.000
Was wünscht du dir für die Erinnerung an die Opfer und
Überlebenden des 7. Oktober?

00:11.400 --> 00:12.266
Oh...

00:15.266 --> 00:17.966
I hate it when they call us heroes...

00:19.400 --> 00:22.500
Because if anyone had asked me,

00:22.500 --> 00:24.400
if I am willing to go through that

00:24.400 --> 00:27.100
I would probably say no.

00:28.800 --> 00:31.366
We didn’t choose it.

00:33.933 --> 00:38.033
We did choose to live close to the border,

00:38.766 --> 00:40.366
but...

00:40.733 --> 00:45.833
We had 100% faith that the IDF

00:46.166 --> 00:49.933
will always be stronger than the other side,

00:50.666 --> 00:55.233
and I must tell you something about this

00:56.066 --> 00:58.766
I hear so many people around the world saying that...

00:58.766 --> 00:59.566
"Oh really?",

00:59.566 --> 01:01.566
"The IDF couldn’t stop them?"

01:01.600 --> 01:07.033
That is the most racist thing you can say,

01:07.200 --> 01:09.233
I know people from Gaza.

01:09.233 --> 01:11.666
There are brilliant people over there.

01:11.733 --> 01:13.133
How racist is that?

01:13.133 --> 01:15.700
What? Because we’re Jewish and they're Arab,

01:15.766 --> 01:19.900
that is unbelievable. I am feeling...

01:20.233 --> 01:22.933
I'm ashamed for my Palestinian friends,

01:22.966 --> 01:24.733
to hear people speak like that.

01:24.900 --> 01:27.533
That particular day, they outsmarted us,

01:27.566 --> 01:31.666
and anybody who thinks that is not possible is a...

01:31.666 --> 01:34.500
that's racism of low expectations.

01:34.633 --> 01:37.833
Excuse me, that's racism of low expectations.

01:38.866 --> 01:41.466
There's no reason why it couldn’t happen.

01:41.666 --> 01:44.633
So how should they remember us?

01:46.433 --> 01:49.733
I think that people need to understand

01:49.733 --> 01:51.500
what Israelis understand,

01:52.166 --> 01:55.366
that if I didn’t live here,

01:55.800 --> 01:59.233
the tunnels would go all the way to Sderot,

02:00.000 --> 02:01.300
or Jerusalem.

02:02.066 --> 02:04.766
For me as a Jew around the world today,

02:04.766 --> 02:06.466
none of us, not the Middle Eastern,

02:06.466 --> 02:08.766
not the North African and not the European Jews,

02:08.866 --> 02:11.866
none of us are safe today.

02:15.633 --> 02:17.833
We know that we need to protect our borders.

02:18.933 --> 02:21.833
We have been living alongside

02:22.366 --> 02:26.300
regimes that were...

02:27.200 --> 02:34.500
most of them were very hostile for 75 years.

02:35.333 --> 02:38.466
We need to keep the borders of our country protected,

02:38.933 --> 02:44.333
because I have every right to live in the Middle East,

02:44.366 --> 02:47.766
practicing my culture, my religion,

02:47.933 --> 02:50.033
holding my head up high,

02:50.033 --> 02:53.400
living in a Jewish culture and community.

02:53.400 --> 02:56.900
I have every right to do that.

02:57.233 --> 03:02.033
As an Israeli sitting here on the fence,

03:03.033 --> 03:05.533
I don’t know if I'll be able to do that anymore,

03:05.533 --> 03:10.066
but it is a very important thing to do,

03:10.200 --> 03:12.200
it’s a very important thing to do.

03:12.200 --> 03:13.933
We understand in the Middle East

03:13.933 --> 03:16.966
what people around the world don’t understand,

03:17.033 --> 03:20.766
because the Middle East used to be little tribes,

03:20.766 --> 03:23.066
